@startuml
' diagram-id: parking-spot-state
' entities: model:parking-spot
title Parking spot occupancy
[*] --> Empty : Construct valid numbered spot
Empty --> Occupied : Park(vehicle) [non-null and Fits(vehicle)] / assign Vehicle
Occupied --> Empty : Clear() / Vehicle = null
Empty --> Empty : Clear() / Vehicle remains null
note right of Empty
  A null argument or a vehicle that does not fit
  causes Park to throw; occupancy is unchanged.
end note
note right of Occupied
  Park throws if the spot is already occupied.
  Garage.Remove calls Clear on a matched spot.
  No separate persisted lifecycle exists.
end note
legend bottom
  [[../../interaction/sequence/parking-sequence.puml Parking sequence]]
  [[../activity/parking-activity.puml Parking activity]]
endlegend
@enduml
